      "cat-harness:section": "Where it runs in the processes",
      "prov:value": "It runs after the step \"Choose the before side\", which picks:\n  - **main's site**, at the publish branch's root, published by the same\n    workflow's `publish-main` job on every push to main;\n  - **for a stacked PR**, its base branch's preview, `branches/<base-slug>/`,\n    so the pictures and the ChangeSet compare with the same branch (bean\n    `5uuf`)."
